  "project_description": "BUEditor is a text editor aiming to facilitate code writing.\n\n Back to top \n\n Features \n \n Completely customizable editor interface \n Ability to create buttons with icons or text \n Per role editor assignments \n Native support for html tags, bbcode tags, and other markup systems \n \n Back to top \n\n Recommended \n \n AJAX Markup (Not needed with Drupal 8 version) \n\nProvides ajax previewing of non-html markup such as bbcode, markdown, etc.\n\nChange your preview button's content to: js: E.prvAjax(); to activate it. \n BUEditor Plus (Not needed with Drupal 8 version) \n\nAssigns editors to input formats, which allows BUEditor to be used interchangeably with WYSIWYG module. \n Markdown editor for BUEditor \n\nProvides a toolbar for Markdown and Markdown Extra markup. \n Back to top",
